Title: Ewan Henderson: Midfielder signs for Wycombe from Belgian side Beerschot
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Wycombe head coach Mike Dodds', 'Text': "Ewan's a really energetic midfielder who's had a great start to his career in the top flights in Scotland and Belgium, and gives us another dimension in the middle of the park.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 62, 'EndChar': 191}}, {'Speaker': 'Wycombe head coach Mike Dodds', 'Text': "He's played a lot of football in the past three years which stands him in good stead to come here and hopefully hit the ground running as he integrates into the squad in pre-season.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 7, 'StartChar': 1, 'EndChar': 156}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Wycombe Wanderers have made midfielder Ewan Henderson their eighth summer signing.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 76}}, {'Description': 'The 25 year-old Scotland youth international has joined from Belgian side Beerschot for an undisclosed fee.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 92}}, {'Description': 'Henderson joins Armando Junior Quitirna, Taylor Allen, Bradley Fink, Caolan Boyd-Munce, Dan Casey, James Tilley and Mikki van Sas in moving to Adams Park during this window.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 152}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Ewan Henderson in action for Beerschot against Sporting Charleroi'}]}
